Initial v0.1.0
- Initial release of ProgressTODO
- Added support for Checkbox, Bar, and nested List todos
- Added weights for todos to affect progress
- Added countdown timers for tasks with start/end dates
- Added Starring, Urgent, and Archiving of todos
- Added localStorage persistence
- Added Copy and Paste of todos as JSON
- Added basic modals for About, Starred, and Urgent
- Implemented minimal clean UI

Update v0.2.0
- Added Drag abd Drop
- Added a Battle Pass
- Added Hiding and Showing Done ToDos with continuous support for Archiving them
- Imporved UI Design
- Fixed issues with Scroll To Top
- ESC key closes all menus and models globally
- Moved app state to pinia powered storage
- Changed the copied data from JSON to CSV, cutting the size of average todolist in half!
- FIX: made all components use the same [ name / label / text ]

Update v0.4.0
- Added a Calendar view: a full month grid, tasks created/due that day, and closest deadline / oldest tasks / overdue panels
- Tasks no longer need a due date — one only counts toward the calendar once you actually set it
- Added "Extract to Board" — pull a nested list out to stand on its own
- Drag a list onto another list to nest it there (the reverse of Extract to Board)
- Added "Arrange" to tidy every list into a grid with one click
- Replaced the third-party emoji picker with our own, styled to match the color picker, with search and categories
- Reworked every dropdown menu (main menu, and every list/checkbox/bar menu) for a more consistent look
- Added an in-app Changelog (About > Changelog)
- FIX: uploading a CSV backup could make the board crash on the next drag
- FIX: the About logo rendered oversized in some places



Update v0.3.0
- Top-level lists live on an infinite board: drag them anywhere, pan by dragging the background or scrolling, zoom with Ctrl + scroll or pinch (25%-200%), zoom controls and "fit all"
- Lock Position for a list on the board, and Lock Layout for all lists; tasks can still be moved in and out of locked lists
- Tasks keep drag and drop within a list and between lists at any zoom; the board pans automatically near the screen edge while dragging
- Archive view: shows every list that holds archived items, archived items at full opacity and the rest of the list dimmed for context; restore or permanently delete from there
- Archived items no longer count towards list progress and are hidden from the board, Starred, Urgent and AI Assist
- Menus open next to their item without covering it and always stay on screen; drag a menu by its handle and drop it next to the item to pin menus of that kind there
- CSV backup now also stores board positions, locks and archive dates (older files still import)
- Data is migrated automatically from the previous version; the old data is kept as a backup
- FIX: adding a list threw an error, Starred/Urgent never showed the parent list name, AI Assist "go to" threw an error



